></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>为践行中国科学院\"科教融合、服务社会\"的使命担当，充分发挥国家级科研机构的资源优势，帮助在校本科生拓展学术视野、了解学科前沿动态，进一步激发青年学子投身科研事业的热情，<span>中国科学院青岛生物能源与过程研究所拟于2025年7月中旬在美丽的海滨城市青岛举办\"清源聚能\"大学生暑期夏令营活动。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/8lrwOFq4xNicSZiaXGnLTuGD2N5ib3T50ibaliavbol5ic80CJfL9VrW9Ls9qWKR3PYVLzFJLcRzm70GT91nkoQQvSWw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>1. 来自</span></span><strong><span><span><span>全国重点高校的生物、</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>材料、化学、化工、环境、食品、能源</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>等相关专业三年级大学在校生(</span><span>即2026届毕业生</span><span>)；</span></span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>2. 本科期间学习成绩优秀，总评成绩排名在本学院或专业前20%之内或具有</span><strong><span>推荐免试研究生资格</span></strong><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span><span><span>英语达到国家</span></span><strong><span><span>四级或六级水平(425分以上)</span></span></strong><span><span>。</span></span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/8lrwOFq4xNicSZiaXGnLTuGD2N5ib3T50ibaliavbol5ic80CJfL9VrW9Ls9qWKR3PYVLzFJLcRzm70GT91nkoQQvSWw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名时间及办法</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/8lrwOFq4xNicSZiaXGnLTuGD2N5ib3T50ibaliavbol5ic80CJfL9VrW9Ls9qWKR3PYVLzFJLcRzm70GT91nkoQQvSWw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1. 报名时间</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>即日-2025年6月15日 </span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>研究所将根据提供的电子材料进行筛选，选中的同学再准备相关纸质版材料（签字、盖章）即可。 </span></span></p><p><span><span>2. 报名办法 </span></span></p><p><span><span>点击链接青岛能源所2025年“清源聚能”夏令营报名</span></span></p><p><span>https://docs.qq.com/form/page/DTVN5aXRza3haV212</span><span>或“扫码”报名。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbi