后重新登录申请系统完成网上报名，承办夏令营单位选择“青岛生物能源与过程研究所”，按要求如</span></span><span>实</span><span><span>填写系统中的各项信息后提交。</span></span><span><span>系统生成“中国科学院大学2025年夏令营申请表”（要求本人签字）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>②本科成绩单和专业排名证明（需加盖教务处或学院公章）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>③其他证明材料（包括已发表论文或出版物复印件、英语四/六级成绩单、各类奖励证书复印件等）。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>注：申请者应保证申请时所提交的所有电子信息及纸版材料的真实性、有效性、完整性，因不实信息或者伪造材料所造成的后果完全由本人承担！</span></span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/8lrwOFq4xNicSZiaXGnLTuGD2N5ib3T50ibaliavbol5ic80CJfL9VrW9Ls9qWKR3PYVLzFJLcRzm70GT91nkoQQvSWw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>其他事宜</span></strong><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/8lrwOFq4xNicSZiaXGnLTuGD2N5ib3T50ibaliavbol5ic80CJfL9VrW9Ls9qWKR3PYVLzFJLcRzm70GT91nkoQQvSWw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1. 参加夏令营活动的学生必须遵守中国科学院青岛能源所的相关规定，按照统一安排参加相关活动。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2. 夏令营活动期间学生安全由本人负责，主办方将会为每位营员购买人身意外伤害保险。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.夏令营期间为营员免费提供食宿，</span></span><span><span>我所将按照一定标准报销营员来程路费以及拟录取推免生的返程路费（具体报销规则另行通知）。</span></span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/8lrwOFq4xNicSZiaXGnLTuGD2N5ib3T50ibaliavbol5ic80CJfL9VrW9Ls9qWKR3PYVLzFJLcRzm70GT91nkoQQvSWw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/8lrwOFq4xNicSZiaXGnLTuGD2N5ib3T50ibaliavbol5ic80CJfL9VrW9Ls9qWKR3PYVLzFJLcRzm70GT91nkoQQvSWw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>联系人：韩老师</span></span></p><p><span><span>电话：0532-80662787</span></span></p><p><span><span>邮箱：yzb@qibebt.ac.cn</span></span></p><p><strong><span>青岛能源所2025“清源聚能”</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>夏令营咨询交流QQ群</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>群号：347900102</span></strong></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/8lrwOFq4xNicSZiaXGnLTuGD2N5ib3T50ibahFSImQrZNoc2ia5MGDOIrXtPvgNzyUU42hujpdYHXuKwZdmxiaL2dQRw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/8lrwOFq4xNicSZiaXGnLTuGD2N5ib3T50ibaliavbol5ic80CJfL9VrW9Ls9qWKR3PYVLzFJLcRzm70GT91nkoQQvSWw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><em><strong><span>Q</span></strong></em></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>为什么要选择青岛能源所？</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><em><strong><span>A</span></strong></em></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>N+1个必来理由！</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/8lrwOFq4xNicbT5pTsQBicjuGajtbzTDgklZBmicsmo6OzLvoK2ZXCLMLj95FiaGguO4YD29kr9Wtibkl7G4UvDDnibQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/8lrwOFq4xNicSZiaXGnLTuGD2N5ib3T50ibaIia3Mu6UQGenfmgybcgh1LCWorS7ZlrpObPcNHHXT23qxo9XWjLtNoA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>所情介绍</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>    中国科学院青岛生物能源与过程研究所</span></strong><span>是由中国科学院、山东省人民政府、青岛市人民政府共建，定位于生物能源与过程领域科技创新的战略高技术研发机构，2009年7月，获批中央事业法人单位。2020年1月，依托研究所院省市三方共建山东能源研究院，同年12月，依托研究所与研究院筹建的青岛新能源山东省实验室挂牌，形成 “所、院、室”三位一体的发展格局。 </span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/8lrwOFq4xNicSZiaXGnLTuGD2N5ib3T50ibaIia3Mu6UQGenfmgybcgh1LCWorS7ZlrpObPcNHHXT23qxo9XWjLtNoA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>交叉融合的学科培养体系</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>面向</span><span><strong><span>“新能源、新生物、新材料”</span></strong></span><span>科技前沿，</span><span>聚焦</span><strong><span>能源领域</span></strong><span>国家战略和地方社会经济需求，以高水平科研带动高层次人才培养，形成了生物、化工、材料、工程相互融合的交叉学科体系，一级学科均进入</span><strong><span>ESI全球前1%行列</span></strong><span>。</span></p><p><span><strong><span>3个博士后流动站</span></strong></span></p><p><span>生物学、化学工程与技术、材料科学与工程</span></p><p><strong><span>4个博士培养点</span></strong></p><p><span>生物学、材料科学与工程、化学工程与技术、材料与化工</span></p><p><strong><span>5个共建本科生菁英班</span></strong></p><p><span>山东大学、中国海洋大学、中国石油大学(华东)等</span></p><p><strong><span>11所科教融合高校</span></strong></p><p><span>山东大学、中国海洋大学、中国石油大学(华东)、山东科技大学等</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/8lrwOFq4xNicSZiaXGnLTuGD2N5ib3T50ibavnmF3KicVicSMMCjy38FZRiafGeTvf7PtXvuzLZqC22NxcNpUzo9yZ2Cw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/8lrwOFq4xNicSZiaXGnLTuGD2N5ib3T50ibaIia3Mu6UQGenfmgybcgh1LCWorS7ZlrpObPcNHHXT23qxo9XWjLtNoA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>严谨治学、潜心科研的导师队伍</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>人员总量</span><strong><span>1500</span></strong><span>余人，博导</span><strong><span>60名</span></strong><span>，硕导</span><strong><span>102名</span></strong><span>。岗聘职工平均年龄40岁，45岁以下职工占比85%，人才专家</span><strong><span>140人次</span></strong><span>。</span></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/8lrwOFq4xNicSZiaXGnLTuGD2N5ib3T50ibaTKyS2Ov6vBUvZUwXtqSDp11PiaAZfdkr4PliaYnm9nKCoqC0apqWdSuA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>了解更多导师信息请扫下方二维码</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/8lrwOFq4xNibpKK7Dbpa3XuY1kYanu4v5sgdDtsRRlHBYQsvZj9s7E1mpBbiaiaibnTzzewWiaAMuNKBTCK5fCNVJEQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/8lrwOFq4xNicSZiaXGnLTuGD2N5ib3T50ibaIia3Mu6UQGenfmgybcgh1LCWorS7ZlrpObPcNHHXT23qxo9XWjLtNoA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>研究生两段式培养模式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>以科技创新为依托，以</span><strong><span>深度科教融合</span></strong><span>为核心，注重</span><strong><span>教学和科研</span></strong><span>相结合，致力于提高研究生的培养质量。</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/8lrwOFq4xNicSZiaXGnLTuGD2N5ib3T50ibaZ2qsI4yZlNS5IfsRFuUfHd2Y1CXmOAU8wyTqUe4Ya4I2ezhOce7Neg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/8lrwOFq4xNicSZiaXGnLTuGD2N5ib3T50ibaCmSlpcnsbvT6PyaltibxhDzrNnW6PgJm7TS6xMURcRszFQsoeTub8Tw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/8lrwOFq4xNicSZiaXGnLTuGD2N5ib3T50ibaIia3Mu6UQGenfmgybcgh1LCWorS7ZlrpObPcNHHXT23qxo9XWjLtNoA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>雄厚的科研实力</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><span>青岛能源所现建有<span>太阳能光电转化与利用全国重点实验室</span>1个国家级创新平台，和<span>青岛新能源山东省实验室、山东省合成生物技术创新中心</span>等21个省部级平台。累计承担各类科研项目2985项，获得竞争性科研经费38.38亿元。累计发表SCI论文5066篇。累计申请专利2322件，其中发明专利2184件，授权专利1058件。</span></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/8lrwOFq4xNicSZiaXGnLTuGD2N5ib3T50ibaXqAtkZ46OH0fuxAiaaE7hOCYqfJtrSTvDReQ4Dtz2d2Tqp4mpTp8N0A/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/8lrwOFq4xNicSZiaXGnLTuGD2N5ib3T50ibaIia3Mu6UQGenfmgybcgh1LCWorS7ZlrpObPcNHHXT23qxo9XWjLtNoA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>丰厚的奖助学金</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>我所研究生在学期间实行奖助学金制度。博士生的奖助学金为</span><strong><span>5500元/月</span></strong><span>-上不封顶，硕士生的奖助学金为</span><strong><span>3500-4000元/月</span></strong><span>，另有全覆盖的学业奖学金，硕士生平均8000元/年，博士生平均13000元/年。我所同时设立高额企业奖学金，国家奖学金等，整体覆盖率30%，单项额度高达1.5万元。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/8lrwOFq4xNicSZiaXGnLTuGD2N5ib3T50ibawWb8yS3yYa9IiaIj82afTnTibSYotBLrpibk7nLVJyVboNibaxjnqmoRrQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/8lrwOFq4xNicSZiaXGnLTuGD2N5ib3T50ibaIia3Mu6UQGenfmgybcgh1LCWorS7ZlrpObPcNHHXT23qxo9XWjLtNoA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>优美的培养环境</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>1.能源所新源路园区</span></strong></p><p><span>青岛市崂山区松岭路189号</span><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/8lrwOFq4xNicSZiaXGnLTuGD2N5ib3T50ibaA736Mib8wrjDmXf0bqW1SJp0gOGpUibKgY4Ybgb4jic2dVSibN0YSZaibNQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><strong><span>2.能源所王哥庄园区</span></strong></p><p><span>青岛市崂山区松岭路1996号</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/8lrwOFq4xNicSZiaXGnLTuGD2N5ib3T50ibaKzXMkc90RcRkPXbCICQTOFvJabatOdyD4efiaO1DjMLQuG98BJA4mrw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/8lrwOFq4xNicSZiaXGnLTuGD2N5ib3T50iba664WQJt8aREcSNhhO7hFzibfC5tOcgZ96ObPOabktFzziaGicyIWE78nA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><strong><span>3.国科大雁栖湖校区</span></strong></p><p><span>北京市怀柔区雁栖湖路1号</span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/8lrwOFq4xNicbT5pTsQBicjuGajtbzTDgkZibgX5qeXraJZpJA4VTeR6lVxV76j7OWWTjKRblXsjUDp6DOYia6vCOQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><span> </span></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/8lrwOFq4xNicSZiaXGnLTuGD2N5ib3T50ibaIia3Mu6UQGenfmgybcgh1LCWorS7ZlrpObPcNHHXT23qxo9XWjLtNoA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>丰富的学生活动</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>研究所建有健身房、足球场、室内篮球馆、羽毛球场、乒乓球台等休闲设施，并且每月均组织健康有益的青年文化活动，充分满足学生的日常活动需求。</span></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/8lrwOFq4xNicbT5pTsQBicjuGajtbzTDgktpnc4G1ecfVTbWvibjicpZVJrwsnOLBg4YIt7P9OiaA2UCdoDXpBj3AnA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/8lrwOFq4xNicSZiaXGnLTuGD2N5ib3T50ibaIia3Mu6UQGenfmgybcgh1LCWorS7ZlrpObPcNHHXT23qxo9XWjLtNoA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>优质的就业平台</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>过去10年，已培养研究生1100余名（含联培生），历年就业率均达 100%。</span></p><section><section><span title=\"\"><p><strong><span>中国科学院</span></strong></p></span></section><section><section><p><span>大连化物所，化学所，青岛能源所，海洋所，兰州化物所，生物物理所，山西煤化所等</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><span title=\"\"><p><strong><span>国内外高校</span></strong></p></span></section><section><section><p><span>国内：中科大，上海交大，同济，浙大，港大，香港城市，南开，南大，山大，大连理工，西安交大，南京航空航天，中海洋，华北电力，中石油（华东），青大，青科，山科等</span></p><p><span>国外：牛津，哈佛，加州大学伯克利分校，阿卜杜拉国王科技大学，德国马普所，多伦多大学，赫尔辛基大学，哥本哈根大学，德累斯顿工业大学，圣安德鲁斯大学等</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><span title=\"\"><p><strong><span>知名企业</span></strong></p></span></section><section><section><p><span>企业：华为，波音（中国），中石化安工院，中兴通讯，宁德时代，比亚迪，海信，万华化学，药明康德，鲁抗医药等</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/8lrwOFq4xNicSZiaXGnLTuGD2N5ib3T50ibaIia3Mu6UQGenfmgybcgh1LCWorS7ZlrpObPcNHHXT23qxo9XWjLtNoA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>更多精彩等你来探索~</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/8lrwOFq4xNicbT5pTsQBicjuGajtbzTDgkTANxOLq73BMuO7qpn5jbcQXZ7g7PD6ooZvDvvdiaWLxQ1y6apDHIYyw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>亲爱的同学们，这个夏天，“清源聚能”夏令营与你不见不散！在这里有顶尖专家讲座、沉浸式科研实践等多元活动；更有优秀学长学姐分享成长经验，结交志同道合的伙伴。无论你是怀揣科研梦想，还是渴望拓宽学术视野，这里都将是你绽放光彩的舞台！</span><strong><span><span>速来报名，期待与你相见！</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/8lrwOFq4xNicbT5pTsQBicjuGajtbzTDgkRCeMPndmte4B7kaGtrW2UvPvbHEprJp9QzILzy7ve5aTpJewvSY3pg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>往期夏令营精彩回顾</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><span>2024“清源聚能”大学生夏令营</span></span></p><p><span><span>（点击图片跳转）</span></sp